DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, du bist wieder da, sehr gut!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Und wie ich sehe, hast du auch
jemanden mitgebracht.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, gut. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich hatte mir schon
gedacht, dass auf dich Verlass ist
und du bald zurück sein würdest.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Whew!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} When you didn't come back,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
I thought something bad might have
happened.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}¡Ufff, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}menos mal!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Me estaba
empezando a preocupar, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pensaba
que te había pasado algo.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Oh, finalmente!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Pensavo fosse
successo qualcosa di grave,
dato che non ti vedevo tornare.{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Huiuiui! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Als du so lange
weggeblieben bist, dachte ich, du
wärst im Wald verschollen oder so!{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Quoi ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Qu'est-ce qui se passe ?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
On peut savoir pourquoi je dois tout
laisser en plan pour venir te voir ?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

IT:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Allora?! Che succede?!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Cos'è
questa storia che devo venire
qui di punto in bianco?!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Allora, spiega un po'. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Che c'è
di così urgente da farmi fare
le corse per venire qui?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:000C:0008:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:000C:0006:}}{{TAG:0003:0006:}}So,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} wo ich schon mal hier bin, sag
halt, was du wolltest. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Aber bisschen
flott, ich hab nicht den ganzen Tag.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Sorry for the rush,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but I wanted to
give this back to you ASAP in case
you needed it.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Perdona las prisas,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}} pero es que
quería devolverte esto enseguida
por si te hacía falta.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Acele ettirdiğim için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama
lazım olur diye bunu sana bir an önce
geri vermek istedim.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Siento haberte hecho venir así,{{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}
pero es que no quería esperar
ni un momento más.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Mira, he ido a comprar y he visto
una cosa que estabas buscando{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Fíjate lo que tengo para ti!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0027:}}Böyle acele çağırdığım için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
ama daha fazla beklemek istemedim.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Dün
alışverişteyken bir süredir aradığın
bir şey buldum{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Gözlerini şuna dik:{{TAG:0003:0026:}} BU!{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0029:}}In deinem Blumenbeet, was?{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Bwa ha.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Lustig, Mädel, sehr lustig.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Als würde ich da rumlungern.
{{TAG:0003:001B:}}Aber das Ding da? {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich glaub schon,
dass es meins ist. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Ich nehm's
jedenfalls mit. {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0002:}}Bwa ha ha!

FR:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Je ne voulais pas te déranger...{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
C'est juste que je me suis souvenue
que tu voulais voir mon chez-moi...
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Et comme je viens de finir le
ménage et le rangement, j'ai pensé
que c'était le moment de t'inviter !{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

DE:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ich hoffe, ich habe dich nicht bei
irgendetwas Wichtigem gestört,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
aber ich bin einfach so aufgeregt!
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Du hast doch mal gesagt, dass du
gerne mein Haus sehen würdest,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
und na ja...
Jetzt habe ich gerade alles geputzt
und aufgeräumt! {{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}Da dachte ich,
jetzt wäre die perfekte Gelegenheit!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Umarım önemli bir şeyini bölmedim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama{{TAG:0003:0025:}}
evimi görmek istediğini söylediğini hatırlıyorum.
{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Az önce her yeri temizleyip düzenledim,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
biraz ziyarete gelsene?{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

EN:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}I'm sorry to drag you away from
whatever you were doing,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} but 
I wanted to ask you something.
Did you put the {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} in
my mailbox yesterday?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}If so, I wanted to say thank you!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
That was very thoughtful.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Siento haberte arrastrado hasta mí
de esta manera, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}pero es que quería
preguntarte una cosa.
¿Fuiste tú el que puso ayer en
mi buzón {{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0005:000F:0000}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}¡Si es así, {{TAG:0007:0000:0A000000}}te lo agradezco mucho!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
¡Eres muy considerado!{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0005:}}{{TAG:000C:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0024:}}Ne yapıyorsan böldüğüm için kusura bakma,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} ama
sana bir şey sormak istedim.
Dün posta kutuma {{TAG:0005:000F:0000}} koyan sen
miydin?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0026:}}Öyleyse teşekkür etmek istedim!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Çok ince düşünmüşsün.{{TAG:000C:0009:}}

{{TAG:000C:0000:}}{{TAG:000C:0007:}}{{TAG:000C:0002:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Evet.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} Bir süredir bundan istediğini biliyordum.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}{{TAG:0003:0021:}}
Satın alabilmek için yaşlı bir adamı kenara
itmek zorunda kaldım.
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Posta kutundan sağlam çıktı mı?{{TAG:0007:0001:}}{{TAG:0003:0015:}} Kutuyu
kapatabilmek için bayağı{{TAG:0003:0006:}} sıkıştırmam gerekti.{{TAG:0003:0000:}}

ES:
{{TAG:000C:0003:}}{{TAG:0003:0025:}}Se acabó lo que se daba.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Si no me contáis nada más,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
me voy a regar el poto.
{{TAG:0003:0015:}}¡Agur!
